# Database Schema Guide

The database schema is defined in [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma) and uses MySQL with Prisma ORM. The main models are:

- `user`: Stores user credentials and profile information
- `role`: Defines user roles
- `userrole`: Maps users to roles (many-to-many)
- `audit`: Logs user actions for audit trails
- `lookup`: Stores lookup values for system-wide use

Refer to the schema file for field-level details and relationships.
